Need ensure hsl signature supports alpha yes. Good.

Now chunk B: updateHUD, prompt, avatar, helpers, geneCost. We will append after drawPanelPreviews. Use edit tail unique snippet ending `  }` of drawPanelPreviews before class close (none). Since current tail is drawPanelPreviews end. We'll append.

Design updateHUD robust.

```
  updateHUD() {
    if (!this.player || !this.pstats) return;
    const p = this.player;
    const s = this.pstats;
    const setText = ...
    // name etc
    const stage = STAGES[p.stage -1];
    const next = STAGES[p.stage];
    const xpFrac = next ? clamp((p.xp - stage.xp)/(next.xp-stage.xp),0,1) : 1;
    ...
    // low health class
    // ability
    // quest q; progress try catch
    // prompt throttle with this.now
    if (!this._hudAt || this.now - this._hudAt > 0.5) { minimap; panel preview; avatar; }
  }
```
Need avoid calling getInteraction every frame? updatePrompt timer 0.12. Use this.now.

Set bar width `${clamp(p.hp/s.maxHp*100,0,100)}%`. also text rounded.

Xp text when final: `${p.xp} XP · MAX` maybe. HUD has stage num. We'll do.
- stage-name maybe `${stage.name}`. Add `stage-num`.
- gen.
- dna.

Lineage: if this.generation>1 || heirs.length, remove hidden else add. But `lineage-card` display flex; hidden class. set.
- quest:
```
const q=QUESTS[this.questIndex];
if(q){ title,text,count `${Math.min(this.questIndex+1,QUESTS.length)}/${QUESTS.length}`; progress; hint}
else { title 'World Without End', text 'All objectives complete...', fill 100, count `${len}/${len}`, hint ...}
```
Quest count maybe current objective number/total. At start 1/11. Good.
- weather text icon/name.
- day.
- low health div opacity p.hp/s.maxHp < .3 ? `.6 + .25 sin` : 0.
- avatar timer update every .3.
- minimap .45.
- prompt .1.
- panel previews .09.
- bigmap not auto (static).
- cache? Text set each frame could cause style layout but okay. Use helper compares maybe. Let's implement `const cache=this._hudCache||(this._hudCache={});` and `txt(id,val)` compare then set. Width too. Avoid heavy.
- `setBar(id,val)` set width only changed.
- quest progress calls q.progress each frame? throttle? q.progress usually cheap. We can compute when quest timer? But okay every frame. Maybe cache. Fine.

`updatePrompt`:
```
if (!this.started||this.dead||this.panel) hide.
const it=this.getInteraction();
const key=`${it?.type}:${it?.label}`; if changed update; show.
```
getInteraction can call nearbyObjects; expensive each 0.12s but okay.
Need avoid prompt when title.
`prompt.classList.add('hidden')` etc.

`updateAvatar`:
```
const c=$('avatar'); if c && p.pheno drawCreaturePreview(c,p.pheno,this.now)
```
Avatar 120; draw preview may use clientWidth 56 (CSS) good.

geneCost.

Potential displayed stats: update.

Let's append.

